    <stdyInfo>
      <abstract>
        The study evaluated the mortality burden of cholera and the quality of patient treatment in cholera treatment units in Lilongwe, Blantyre, Mangochi and Nkhata-Bay districts in Malawi. The purpose of this study was to better understand the factors contributing to the high cholera mortality burden in these districts and to identify areas for improvement in patient treatment.
      </abstract>
      <sumDscr>
        <nation abbr="MW">
          Malawi
        </nation>
        <geogCover>
          Lilongwe, Blantyre, Mangochi and Nkhata-Bay
        </geogCover>
        <dataKind>
          Sample survey data [ssd]
        </dataKind>
      </sumDscr>
    </stdyInfo>
  </stdyDscr>
